{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">美的集團上半年純利按年上升百分之1.6。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">超過264億元人民幣。中期息維持每10股派5元人民幣。期內收入2,610億元人民幣，增長百分之3.4。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-28T23:38:52.642292+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":72,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}